# Usefulness: Water availability is crucial for forest cover. Cells with closer vertical proximity to hydrology may be wetter. This ratio allows better characterization of terrain’s relationship to water.
df['Water_Distance_Ratio'] = df['Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology'] / (df['Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology'].abs() + 1)  # Adding 1 to avoid division by 0

