1. Combining Soil Type Indicators into a Single Categorical Feature:
python
# Combined_Soil_Type
# Feature description: Combines all Soil_Type indicators into a single categorical feature representing unique soil types.
# Usefulness: Consolidates 40 binary features into a single categorical feature, potentially helping the model focus on patterns across soil types. Reduces dimensionality and makes soil types easier to interpret downstream.
df['Combined_Soil_Type'] = df.loc[:, [f'Soil_Type{i}' for i in range(1, 41)]].idxmax(axis=1)
