# Rugged_Slope_Interaction
# Feature description: Multiply Terrain_Ruggedness_Index by Slope. This interaction captures how changes in ruggedness are emphasized by steep slopes, which can affect vegetation patterns and forest cover types.
# Usefulness: Ruggedness and slope influence soil stability, erosion, and vegetation growth. Amplifying these variables together can highlight spatial areas with unique cover requirements.
df['Rugged_Slope_Interaction'] = df['Terrain_Ruggedness_Index'] * df['Slope']
end

